# Only what the image needs: pyproject.toml, uv.lock, src, alembic.ini and
# migrations. Everything else stays out, above all secrets.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!alembic.ini
!migrations

# Never copy local state, even inside the folders above.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/credentials.local.md
